<abstract lang="en"><p>A method for two nodes to determine a common secret.</p></abstract>
<description id="desc" lang="en">
<heading id="h0001"><b>Technical Field</b></heading>
<p id="p0001" num="0001">The present disclosure relates to determining a common secret for two nodes.</p>
<heading id="h0002"><b>Summary</b></heading>
<p id="p0002" num="0002">The method uses hierarchical deterministic keys with <sub>subscript</sub> notation and a figure <img id="f0001" file="f1.tif"/></p>
</description>
<claims id="claims01" lang="en">
<claim id="c-en-01-0001" num="0001"><claim-text>A computer-implemented method of determining a common secret (CS) at a first node (C).</claim-text></claim>
<claim id="c-en-01-0002" num="0002"><claim-text>The method of claim 1, further comprising deriving a hierarchical key.</claim-text></claim>
